      "title": "Shooting Ranges",
      "summary": "Overview of outdoor and indoor shooting-range siting, safety provisions, range layouts, and competition disciplines. Outdoor ranges should be located away from public roads and buildings, ideally in a wooded gully with a surrounding hillside. Diagrams show a covered air-gun range, a small-calibre target-pulling range, and a combined rifle range. Safety measures include overhead and side baffles, side protection, and a safety embankment. The text also describes approval requirements in Germany and the UK.",
